              <p>Use Calibre for library management, conversion, and bulk operations; use Sigil when you need direct, code-level control over the EPUB package — fixing OPF issues, refining CSS per-reader, or validating structure before publishing. They complement each other, and serious self-publishers typically keep both installed.</p>
